---
// Portfolio Page - Minnaar-Matthews Creative House
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Portfolio | Minnaar-Matthews</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Jost:wght@300;400;500&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,500;0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  </head>
  <body style="background-color: #F5F2EB; color: #2C2A29; font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif; margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
    
    <!-- Fixed Atmospheric Background Visual -->
    <div style="position: fixed; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 0; opacity: 0.15; background-image: url('/hero-bg.png'); background-size: cover; background-position: center; filter: grayscale(100%) contrast(125%);"></div>

    <!-- Header Navigation -->
    <header style="position: relative; z-index: 10; padding: 2rem 3rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(227, 222, 212, 0.8); background-color: rgba(245, 242, 235, 0.9);">
      <a href="/" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; letter-spacing: 0.2em; font-size: 1.125rem; text-transform: uppercase; color: #2C2A29; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;">Minnaar-Matthews</a>
      <a href="/" style="font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.35em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #2C2A29; text-decoration: none;">&larr; Back to Home</a>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Portfolio Content -->
    <main style="position: relative; z-index: 10; flex-grow: 1; max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 5rem 2rem; width: 100%;">
      <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4rem;">
        <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.4em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #7A756D; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Curated Visual Archival</span>
        <h1 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 4.5rem); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #2C2A29; margin: 0;">Portfolio</h1>
        <div style="width: 3rem; height: 1px; background-color: #C5BEB0; margin: 1.5rem auto 0 auto;"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Forced 3-Column Side-by-Side Grid Container -->
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 2.5rem; width: 100%;">
        
        <!-- Tile 1 -->
        <div style="background-color: rgba(235, 230, 218, 0.95); border: 1px solid #DDD6C8; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 1.5rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);">
          <div style="width: 100%; height: 16rem; overflow: hidden; position: relative; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; background-color: #DFD9CC;">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Architectural & Interior Series" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;" />
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: space-between;">
            <div>
              <span style="font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #7A756D; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Architectural Study</span>
              <h3 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.25rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-weight: 500; color: #2C2A29;">Spatial Elegance</h3>
              <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: #5C5750; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 300; margin: 0;">Precision lighting and modern structural composition capturing high-end architectural design lines.</p>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top: 2rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid #DFD9CC; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #2C2A29;">
              <span>Explore Series</span>
              <span>&rarr;</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tile 2 -->
        <div style="background-color: rgba(235, 230, 218, 0.95); border: 1px solid #DDD6C8; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 1.5rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);">
          <div style="width: 100%; height: 16rem; overflow: hidden; position: relative; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; background-color: #DFD9CC;">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542038784456-1ea8e935640e?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Editorial Portraiture" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;" />
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: space-between;">
            <div>
              <span style="font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #7A756D; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Editorial Direction</span>
              <h3 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.25rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-weight: 500; color: #2C2A29;">Atmospheric Portraiture</h3>
              <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: #5C5750; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 300; margin: 0;">Curated studio visual narratives centered around mood, organic texture, and refined aesthetic storytelling.</p>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top: 2rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid #DFD9CC; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #2C2A29;">
              <span>Explore Series</span>
              <span>&rarr;</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tile 3 -->
        <div style="background-color: rgba(235, 230, 218, 0.95); border: 1px solid #DDD6C8; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 1.5rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);">
          <div style="width: 100%; height: 16rem; overflow: hidden; position: relative; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; background-color: #DFD9CC;">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600596542815-ffad4c1539a9?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Commercial Digital Showcase" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;" />
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: space-between;">
            <div>
              <span style="font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #7A756D; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Commercial Showcase</span>
              <h3 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.25rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-weight: 500; color: #2C2A29;">Bespoke Craft & Scale</h3>
              <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: #5C5750; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 300; margin: 0;">Custom digital branding, high-end client showcases, and tailored interactive visual presentations.</p>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top: 2rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid #DFD9CC; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #2C2A29;">
              <span>Explore Series</span>
              <span>&rarr;</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer style="position: relative; z-index: 10; padding: 2rem 3rem; text-align: center; font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; border-top: 1px solid #E3DED4; color: #7A756D; background-color: rgba(245, 242, 235, 0.9);">
      &copy; 2026 Minnaar-Matthews Creative House. All Rights Reserved.
    </footer>

  </body>
</html>